<span style="color:#1E3A8A;font-weight:600">Net worth discrepancy (minor):</span> The KPI table states Net Worth = ₹3,058.3 crore for FY25, while the separate Equity Reconciliation (I-GAAP to IFRS) table in the same presentation states I-GAAP equity of ₹3,060.8 crore as at 31 March 2025 — a ~₹2.5 crore gap likely due to rounding or minority-interest treatment. The KPI table figure (3,058.3) is used above as the primary reported metric.
